**Why it is a package.** Each notebook's setup cell runs `pip install` on this repository, so the
helper `{{ package_name }}` is built as a normal Python package (hatchling) and installs anywhere pip
does. It supports Python {{ min_python }} to {{ max_python }}; CI runs the notebooks on {{ colab_python }}, the Python of
Google Colab's current runtime.

